WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.400
Now, suppose all we know
is that Maya is a student.

00:04.400 --> 00:06.480
Is she enrolled in law school?

00:06.480 --> 00:07.960
We don't know.

00:07.960 --> 00:10.800
She could be studying history.

00:10.800 --> 00:14.800
Being a student doesn't tell us
which subject she studies.
